  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Int 210.03 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The board shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing, or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration within 30 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. #7852-A, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11 (from Int 211.02); ss by #10359, eff 6-14-13",
